## Use when

When adopting the product is literally one action.

## Avoid when

Complex products whose first step isn't representative.

## Pairs with

Narrated proof, Benchmark as headline

Measured on: Jog, Clay (app home), Melius, Handwired.

Rules: Rebuild from these measurements, never from a real site's code, text, logos or imagery. A font in <angle brackets> is a placeholder: pick a licensed face of that kind. Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
